---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About & Archive" description="Background, credentials, and personal signals.">
  <section class="container section grid gap-8">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker">About & Archive</span>
      <h1 class="serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl">The marketer behind the signal.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-2xl">
        I'm currently Senior Product Activation Manager, Agent Marketing at Zillow. I started
        Future of Real Estate Marketing (FOREM), later acquired by Inman News, and became a Partner
        and Chief Strategist at 1000watt leading marketing, content, and product strategy for
        hundreds of real estate brands.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Career Snapshot</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          <li>Senior Product Activation Manager, Agent Marketing — Zillow (2022-present)</li>
          <li>Senior Product Marketing Manager, Showcase — Zillow (2022-present)</li>
          <li>Manager, Industry Marketing & Strategy — Zillow (2022)</li>
          <li>Product Marketing Manager — Bridge (2021-2022)</li>
          <li>Chief Strategist — 1000watt (2009-2020)</li>
          <li>VP of Content — Inman News (2007-2009)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Education</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          B.A. Political Science, University of British Columbia.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Personal Signal</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          "Performance follows attitude." Board Member and Marketing Lead for Foothills Soccer Club.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Skills</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          Product activation, product marketing, content strategy, messaging, UX, and launch planning.
          Tools: HubSpot, Mailchimp, WordPress.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10">
      <span class="kicker">Testimonials</span>
      <div class="mt-4 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="serif text-xl">Matt Shadbolt</p>
          <p class="text-[color:var(--muted)] mt-1">Head of Product, NBC News</p>
          <blockquote class="mt-3 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            "Joel's writing has always been a fascinating read, and the work he produced during his
            tenure on FOREM was instrumental in shaping much of Corcoran's interactive initiatives.
            He has an innate ability to source not only the most interesting stories and provide
            unique perspective, but also to see what's coming far in advance of others, a rare skill."
            "Joel's work is not only influential within the industry, but a key resource for anyone
            interested in how the real estate industry is adapting to the increased technological
            needs of its clients. Joel sees and understands this, and his guidance at the agent
            through to the brokerage level has been an incredible thing to watch evolve."
            "Truly one of the brightest stars working in the space where real estate and technology
            intersect, I would highly recommend Joel to anyone who wants a glimpse into the future
            of the industry."
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="serif text-xl">Morgan Brown</p>
          <p class="text-[color:var(--muted)] mt-1">Chief Growth Officer, Opendoor</p>
          <blockquote class="mt-3 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            "Joel is the unique individual who combines a keen technology perspective with the
            necessary know-how to make that perspective pay-off in business. His forward-looking,
            thoughtful analysis of technology trends in real estate make him a respected authority
            in both fields."
            "Joel doesn't just promote technology for technology's sake. Rather, he scrutinizes it
            for its business value and application both now and in the future. This realistic
            assessment makes his voice one to trust in the space."
            "In addition to his business acumen Joel is a personable, intelligent individual who
            always brings a lot to the table in any capacity. I enjoy my conversations with Joel,
            because I learn so much every time I speak with him."
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="serif text-xl">Steven Contreras</p>
          <p class="text-[color:var(--muted)] mt-1">Creative Director, Brand & Marketing at Eko Health</p>
          <blockquote class="mt-3 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            "As the VP of Content, Joel lead the strategic direction of Inman News including the
            Editorial, Marketing, IT and Events departments. I reported to Joel and he provided
            what I consider to be the ideal work environment: he challenged my work and provided
            excellent feedback and criticism that made our work better, and at the same time gave
            me the creative freedom and space to work out new design challenges myself."
            "He's also super smart, a great communicator, and has a really good sense of humor. I'd
            welcome the chance to work with him again."
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10">
      <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
        Email: <a class="underline" href="mailto:jburslem@gmail.com">jburslem@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Phone: 971-285-0049</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
        Open to strategy audits and advisory roles.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
